{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"feel\": \"一开始有种突然袭来的郑重和激动，仿佛有什么非常重要的东西一下子触动了人。随后这份强烈渐渐变得柔和，带着向往，却仍有一点不安和悬而未决的感觉。\",\n  \"thread\": \"有时人还说不清自己究竟盼望什么，就已经真切地感到它对自己很重要。这份在意来得强烈，却不是非要立刻抓住什么；当最初的激动过去，留下的是愿意亲近、珍惜它的温柔。只是被打动不等于已经拥有，心里有了期待，却还没有可以安心的着落。\",\n  \"used\": \"无\",\n  \"new\": [\n    \"有一份真实而强烈的在意已经出现，但它所指向的满足还没有被说清。\",\n    \"这份在意不只有急切，也有温柔和珍惜；即使激动平息，它仍然存在。\",\n    \"期待已经产生，却还没有实际的满足可以让人安心。\"\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": \"无\"\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cfe5dc76-6b6a-470f-94f6-c2e5131f86db", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T223906573365Z", "elapsed_seconds": 76.078, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T22:40:22.660205+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8ce7ad25f69de5300f37266a0b15c825ad100b678a7fdccbb467ed381ca6e3fe", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c1